      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Even after you’ve expended its power, you can reclaim a story’s power to be told a second time. Whenever you use a Cardplay action that Plays a Card, you can use the Sleight effect of this feat.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Sleight </strong>You recall the card used in the action back into your hand. If it was a Wild Card, it returns as the suit you designate it as.</p>"
